Because we moved checking to runtime, `RefCell` will **panic** (not compile-error) if you accidentally hold a mutable borrow (`borrow_mut`) and try to borrow the same cell immutably (`borrow`) simultaneously in the same scope. The code above avoids that by never holding a borrow across another borrow of the same cell.

